 build le plus joué passe par Lame spectre de Youmuu, Bottes de lucidité et Manamune (47,4 % de victoires). Moins courant, le build OFF-META Lame spectre de Youmuu, Bottes de célérité et Cyclosabre voltaïque atteint 61,7 % sur 60 parties. Il s'en sort le mieux contre Yasuo, Irelia et LeBlanc. Il souffre surtout contre Malzahar, Zoé et Xerath.","en":"On patch 16.22, Jayce mid has a 49.4% win rate over 4,408 ranked games (Emerald+), A tier. The most played build goes Youmuu's Ghostblade, Ionian Boots of Lucidity and Manamune (47.4% win rate). Less common, the OFF-META build Youmuu's Ghostblade, Boots of Swiftness and Voltaic Cyclosword reaches 61.7% over 60 games. It does best against Yasuo, Irelia and LeBlanc. It struggles most against Malzahar, Zoe and Xerath."}}